WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.520
Number ten, your self-respect and your identity.

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:05.000
Are your everyday choices aligned with the

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:06.200
person that you say you are?

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:08.520
Think about your standards, your boundaries and

00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:09.920
whether you keep promises to yourself.

